window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p></p><p><b>Best friends? With a celebrity? Impossible.</b></p><p>That's how Sesali feels after a chance encounter with super producer Dash Dean. His offer of friendship has to be a smoke screen for an ulterior motive. Besides, she already has best friends, and one of them has staked a claim on Dash.</p><p>Does it count if she never had a chance?</p><p>Dash has eyes for Sesali, and Sesali only. She's the first person who's made him question his solitary lifestyle in a long while.</p><p>Can he convince her to let him be down?</p><p></p>"; 
